{{Quote|Upper Pabu is the oldest part of the island. As we've grown over the years, we've expanded below the wall into Lower Pabu.|[[Shep Hazard]]|<ref name="Pabu" />}}
'''Upper Pabu''' was the older part of the [[Pabu (island)|remote island]] on [[Pabu]]. It was home to the [[Archium]] and defended by a large seawall that protected the area from [[Tsunami|sea surges]].<ref name="Pabu" /> During or after [[18 BBY]],<ref name="Date">{{TBBDate|213}}</ref> when a sea surge damaged the newer part of the island, [[Lower Pabu]], the islanders retreated here, aided by [[Clone Force 99]] and [[Phee Genoa]].<ref name="Pabu" />

